---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="CLI: shipnote"
  description="Reference for the shipnote CLI: fetch the nightly dataset and select the commits worth a post."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-20 pb-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">CLI</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-zinc-400">
      The CLI runs on your machine. It downloads the nightly dataset and selects the commits worth a post. Drafting and review come later.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-14 text-2xl font-semibold">Requirements</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">
      <a href="https://bun.sh" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">Bun</a>, git, and the GitHub CLI signed in with <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">gh auth login</code>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">fetch</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">
      Downloads the newest successful nightly run, or the run you name, into <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">archive/&lt;date&gt;/</code>. If that date is already archived, it does nothing.
    </p>
    <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-zinc-950 p-5 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400"><code>bun cli/shipnote.ts fetch
bun cli/shipnote.ts fetch --date 2026-10-30 --run 41067258484</code></pre>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">select</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">
      Reads the archive for a date and prints the commits ranked by score. Merges, lockfile-only changes, commits already in <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">ledger.json</code>, and denylisted repos are skipped, and the reason for each skip is counted.
    </p>
    <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-zinc-950 p-5 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-400"><code>bun cli/shipnote.ts select
bun cli/shipnote.ts select --date 2026-10-30</code></pre>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Settings</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08]">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-400">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Variable</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Default</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Purpose</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="text-zinc-400">
          <tr class="border-t border-white/[0.08]">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-zinc-200">SHIPNOTE_REPO</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">abhiudayg/shipnote</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">The repo whose artifacts <code class="font-mono">fetch</code> downloads. Set it to your fork.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-white/[0.08]">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-zinc-200">SHIPNOTE_DENYLIST</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">empty</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Comma-separated repos to exclude from selection.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Coming next</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">
      Drafting, review, and approval commands. The CLI does not read <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">shipnote.toml</code> yet.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
